[4.318463, "o", "✔ Q6: the decision of the owner on an approval writes one outcome for each decision record that led to it (332.620224ms)\r\n"]
[4.613329, "o", "✔ Q3: start a task writes one record for each answer, with no text of the message; a second run does not ask again (294.585008ms)\r\n"]
[4.784752, "o", "✔ Q4: below the level goes to the owner as one question, no task starts, and the event is not lost (171.73649ms)\r\n"]
[4.940189, "o", "✔ Q4: an answer that is not an option goes to the owner as one question, no task starts, and the event is not lost (154.984114ms)\r\n"]
