[6.871033, "o", "== The demo: npm run dev:platform runs in a second terminal. The plan example with $15 and $60.\r\n"]
[11.13843, "o", "\r\n$ DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:spike@127.0.0.1:5433/ts_demo npm run demo:decisions --silent\r\n"]
[11.539638, "o", "== The owner sets a rule: refunds of $20 or less, for the reasons \"damaged or missing\"\r\n"]
[11.571481, "o", "POST /v1/commands SetRule -> 200 {\"status\":\"accepted\",\"commandId\":\"rule-1795080766909\"}\r\n"]
[11.57173, "o", "\r\n== The customer writes: \"My eggs arrived broken. I want my $15 back.\"\r\n   The owner asks: \"Please read 2 files, then refund 15 to cust-1\" (task eggs-15-1795080766909)\r\n"]
[11.614527, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage -> 200 {\"status\":\"accepted\",\"commandId\":\"eggs-15-1795080766909\"}\r\n"]
[13.777775, "o", "GET /v1/tasks/eggs-15-1795080766909 -> status done\r\n"]
[13.779368, "o", "   approval requests: 0\r\n"]
