[13.781931, "o", "   point            decider  message_seq  answer  probability  shadow  used   ms\r\n"]
[13.782038, "o", "   message-safe     fixed    907669091    yes     0.99         false   true   0\r\n"]
[13.782274, "o", "   reason-in-rule   fixed    907669091    yes     0.99         false   true   0\r\n"]
[13.782371, "o", "   refund-request   fixed    907669091    yes     0.99         false   true   0\r\n"]
[13.782448, "o", "   request-clear    fixed    907669092    yes     0.99         false   true   1\r\n"]
[13.78257, "o", "   which-bot        fixed    907669092    test-bot 0.99         false   true   1\r\n"]
[13.783295, "o", "   action refund: done\r\n"]
[13.783419, "o", "\r\n== The customer writes: \"My eggs arrived broken. I want my $15 back.\"\r\n"]
[13.783495, "o", "   The owner asks: \"Please read 2 files, then refund 60 to cust-1\" (task eggs-60-1795080766909)\r\n"]
[13.821159, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage -> 200 {\"status\":\"accepted\",\"commandId\":\"eggs-60-1795080766909\"}\r\n"]
[16.391644, "o", "GET /v1/tasks/eggs-60-1795080766909 -> status waiting for the owner\r\n"]
